flowchart TB
    accTitle: Fridge sensor hardware
    accDescr: Battery and sensing components from Fridge.drawio. This is a block diagram.
    %% Main fridge: 173 × 91 cm. The sensor mounts inside the door in an IP65 enclosure with silica desiccant.
    %% PlatformIO C++ / FreeRTOS with deep sleep. BLE GATT telemetry uses AES-128-GCM.
    %% Onboard LDR GPIO 36, HT16K33 LED matrix (0x70), S1 GPIO 16 and S2 GPIO 14.
    %% SGP40 VOC index 0–500. A MOSFET on GPIO 18 gates the heater.
    %% SHT31 relative humidity is used for SGP40 compensation.

    battery["18650 battery + BMS"]
    fridge_sensor["F0 · KidBright32 / ESP32<br/>Deep sleep · IP65 with desiccant"]
    light["Onboard LDR · GPIO 36"]
    voc["SGP40 · VOC"]
    temperature["SHT31 · Temperature and humidity"]

    battery --> fridge_sensor
    fridge_sensor --- light
    fridge_sensor ---|"I2C1 · 0x59"| voc
    fridge_sensor ---|"I2C1 · 0x44"| temperature
    %% I2C1 uses GPIO 21/22.
